@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 代码审查
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/code/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "code": "public String greet(String name) { return \"Hello \" + name; }"
}

### 2. 生成测试计划
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/code/tests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "code": "public int divide(int a, int b) { return a / b; }"
}

### 3. 生成实现
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/code/implement
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "code": "实现一个方法，接收字符串并去除首尾空白；null 返回空字符串。"
}

### 4. 凭据输入被拒绝
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/code/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "language": "java",
  "code": "String password = \"secret\";"
}
